column2:
Our Father, who art in heaven, hallowed be thy name; thy kingdom come; thy will be done, as in heaven so also upon earth;
28060b0021	give us this day our daily bread;
28060c0034	and forgive us our debts, as we forgive our debtors;
28060d008a	and lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from the evil one: for thine is the kingdom, and the power, and the glory for ever. Amen.

For he that would desire life, and see good days, let him refrain his tongue from evil, and his lips that they speak no guile;
3c030b0029	let him turn away from evil, and do good:
3c030c00b2	let him seek peace, and pursue it: for the eyes of the Lord are upon the righteous, and his ears are open to their prayer: but the face of the Lord is against them that do evil.
